  "description": "A four bedroom townhouse with flexible accommodation throughout, in sought-after Kingston Road.\n\n\rThe property has been reconfigured by the current owners to create a large kitchen/dining room on the ground floor with French doors opening to the west-facing split-level courtyard garden.\n\nDownstairs, on the lower ground floor, the property benefits from a utility room with external access and a sitting room with log burner and bi-fold doors to the garden.\n\nOn the first floor are two double bedrooms, one to the rear with ensuite shower room and another to the front with bay window. There is also a family bathroom on this level.\n\nUpstairs, on the second floor, are two further double bedrooms and another family bathroom. The double bedroom to the front benefits from an attractive spiral staircase leading to a flexible, carpeted loft room.\n\nTo the exterior, the west facing rear garden is split-level and offers two seating areas, perfect for al-fresco dining in the warmer months. The front of the property is enclosed by wrought iron railings and gate, with steps leading to the lower ground floor.",
